---
import { SITE_TITLE_HEADER } from "../../consts";
---

<h1 class="my-4 border-b-2 text-2xl text-primary-800">Why us</h1>
<div
  class="mainContainer grid justify-center gap-12 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3">
  <div>
    <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">Quality</h2>
    <p>
      Our team brings an abundance of expertise to each project, ensuring
      reliable and tailored solutions. We commit to precision, meticulous
      attention to detail, and adherence to industry standards, making
      excellence the essence of our work.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">Innovation</h2>
    <p>
      We push boundaries with creative ideas and cutting-edge technology to
      optimise performance, maximise efficiencies, and exceed expectations. We
      employ digital tools to facilitate project implementation and decision
      making.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">On time, on budget</h2>
    <p>
      We understand the significance of delivering projects on time and within
      budget. We manage projects efficiently, ensuring they stay on track,
      aligning perfectly with the schedules and financial goals of our clients.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">Sustainability</h2>
    <p>
      We build for the future. We design structures that stand the test of time,
      reducing waste, and minimising environmental impact. We are committed to
      practice engineering in an ethical and socially responsible manner.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">Collaboration</h2>
    <p>
      Collaboration is at the heart of our work. We collaborate closely with you
      and all stakeholders, ensuring transparent communication and seamless
      project execution. We build strong relationships that lead to project
      success.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">Safe by design</h2>
    <p>
      We prioritise safety in our designs to proactively prevent accidents and
      hazards during construction and operation. Our structures can be assembled
      and used safely, providing confidence to clients, and to the community.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
